---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
---

<GuideLayout 
  title="The Ultimate Logistics Guide: Shipping Activewear from China"
  type="SUPPLY CHAIN & LOGISTICS"
  description="Navigate the complexities of international shipping. From Guangzhou factory floor to your warehouse in Miami or Europe."
>
  <p>For global activewear brands, the efficiency of the supply chain from the <strong>Guangzhou factory floor to your warehouse</strong> determines your time-to-market and profit margins.</p>
  
  <div class="my-10 bg-slate-900 text-white p-10 rounded-3xl text-center">
    <h3 class="text-[#C9A84C] mt-0">Strategic Logistics Hub</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mt-8">
      <div><p class="text-xl font-bold">Guangzhou</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#C9A84C] uppercase">Airport</p></div>
      <div><p class="text-xl font-bold">Shenzhen</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#C9A84C] uppercase">Port</p></div>
      <div><p class="text-xl font-bold">Hong Kong</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#C9A84C] uppercase">Airfreight</p></div>
      <div><p class="text-xl font-bold">Miami</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#C9A84C] uppercase">Partner Hub</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Choosing the Right Shipping Method</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Air Express:</strong> Best for samples and small orders (50-200 pcs). Transit: 3-5 days.</li>
    <li><strong>Air Freight:</strong> Best for bulk over 300kg. Transit: 7-10 days.</li>
    <li><strong>Sea Freight:</strong> Best for large stock replenishments. Transit: 25-45 days.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Customs & Duties</h3>
  <p>We provide full documentation and DDP (Delivered Duty Paid) services for the US and EU, handling all taxes and customs clearance for you.</p>

  <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl">
    <h3 class="text-[#C9A84C] mt-0">Need a Shipping Quote?</h3>
    <p>We can calculate DDP shipping rates for your order within 1 hour. Contact our logistics team today.</p>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
